// title: Visualization of successful PIM activiations · Sentinel
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Entra
// tables: AuditLogs
// purpose: This query visualises the PIM activation performed by accounts. A user who has used many different PIM roles may be interesting to examine, it could be that a users always asigns their PIM access rights without needing them all the time. The same goes for PIM roles with high privileges.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Azure%20Active%20Directory/Visualization%20-%20PimActivation.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
// license: BSD-3-Clause (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
AuditLogs
| where OperationName == "Add member to role completed (PIM activation)"
| summarize TotalActivations = count() by Identity
| sort by TotalActivations
| render columnchart
